A caption line holding only a comment makes no caption

```
| a |
^ %% x
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>^</p>
```

```
> q
^ %% x
.
<blockquote><p>q
^</p></blockquote>
```

```
> q

^ %% x
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
<p>^</p>
```

```
| a |
^ {% x %}y
.
<table>
  <caption>y</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a |
^ {% x %}y %% z
.
<table>
  <caption>y</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
